    "details": {
      "alignment": "Lawful Evil",
      "type": {
        "value": "humanoid",
        "subtype": "Beanish"
      },
      "cr": 0.5,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Fawful's Forces packet sheet — Beanish Garrison Trooper.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-forge-packets.py</code> from the NPC Forge roster <code>data/forge/fawfuls-forces.json</code> (entry <code>garrison-trooper</code>): Small humanoid (Beanish), Lawful Evil; CR 1/2 (proficiency +2, to hit +4 with DEX); AC 14 (garrison coat (padded) and cap), hit points 16 (3d6+6), speed 30 ft.. A GM scene kit for the Fawful's Forces article's present (1040 BF), not a filed event; the faction article stays the authority.</p><p>The beans who came with Fawful and the beans who joined him once the castle fell — the garrison is both, in one coat. The faction article's first Fury Meter rung is plainly \"minions\", and a trooper is that: a spark-lance, a cap with a swirl on it, a chant they are drilled to shout at the first drop of blood. They hold doors, walk prisoners and stand in front of the vats.</p><p>In numbers they are an infantry line with reach; alone they fold. The war cry is the thing to watch — it moves every construct in earshot a step closer — so a party that wants a quiet corridor silences the trooper first.</p><p><strong>Role:</strong> line infantry · <strong>tier:</strong> minion · <strong>folder:</strong> Fawful's Furious Freaks / The Bean Garrison.</p><h3>Art</h3><p>Token plate <code>portraits/fawfuls-forces/garrison-trooper.png</code> — NPC Forge render, seed 410007, cut from a flat #FF00FF field. Prompt: <q>Clean cel-shaded cartoon character art in the style of Mario & Luigi RPG concept art, bold dark outlines, flat colours, simple shading. A small lime-green bean-shaped humanoid soldier with a wide grin and round eyes, wearing a dark green military uniform coat with belt and a peaked officer's cap with a spiral badge, brown boots, holding a long brass spark-lance polearm crackling with blue electricity. Full body, whole figure visible, three-quarter view, centred, isolated on a plain flat solid magenta background (#FF00FF), no floor, no ground shadow, no text, no border.</q></p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
